    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d158">

                <pb facs="0352" n="346" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg346"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Stevens to Mr.
                            Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 21.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United
                                States Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Honolulu</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1891-03-26"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 26, 1891</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Your dispatch 15, of February 28, was
                    received at this legation March 15. The chief portion thereof, all that relates
                    to the late King Kalakaua and to Her Majesty the Queen, was duly communicated to
                    the minister of foreign affairs, with the request that it should be read or
                    otherwise made known to her, in a note dated March 17, to which I have received
                    a response, a full copy of which is herewith inclosed.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John L. Stevens.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d158-a1.xml" xpointer="d158-a1"/>
            </div>
